  checkTorusCertificateV2_refined_of
    (landedBase_check_of mag_static mag_hamBounds mag_embedding mag_csInvariance
      mag_csEnergy mag_csGram mag_csTorsion)
    mag_hamClaim mag_frame mag_refinedCore

/-- **`Graph_passes`**, from its four conjuncts. -/
